  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultant assignment on youth development - post Promundo - Consultant assignment on youth development after Promundo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultuppdrag om h&#xe5;llbar ungdomsutveckling - efter Promundo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r en bed&#xf6;mning av projeketet om unga m&#xe4;n klubar mot v&#xe5;ld (Young Men&apos;s Clubs against violence (YMCA)  som har genomf&#xf6;rts under de senaste tre &#xe5;ren f&#xf6;r att f&#xe5; ungdomar ur v&#xe5;ldsamma grupper i Kinshasa. Fokus f&#xf6;r utv&#xe4;rderingen &#xe4;r att se vilka omr&#xe5;den som skulle kunna utvecklas f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla att ungdomarna inte frestas att &#xe5;terv&#xe4;nda till grupperna &#xe4;ven efter att ha deltagit i projektets aktiviteter. Bed&#xf6;mningen handlar allts&#xe5; om att identifiera olika m&#xf6;jligheter att f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rka h&#xe5;llbarheten f&#xf6;r projektets resultat.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an assessment of the Young Men&apos;s Clubs against Violence that has been implemented for the last three years to get young people out of violent Groups in Kinshasa. The focus of the assessment is to see what areas could be developed to ensure the youth are not temptated to return to the Groups even after participating into the project&apos;s activities. The assessment is a study on sustainability of the project&apos;s results.</narrative>
  </description>
